    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d481">

                <pb facs="0466" n="368" xml:id="pg368"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Nabeshima to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Japan</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Hay</hi>: In reference to our
                    conversation this morning, I beg to inform you that I have just received a
                    telegram from Viscount Aoki, announcing the decision of the Imperial Government
                    to dispatch at once one mixed division, which will make the total strength of
                    Japanese forces in China about 22,000.</p>
                <p>Yours, very truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nabeshima.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
